        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Virgo &mdash; 4th (Ultimate) Technique, gained at level 16.</em></p><p><em>The Six Realms of Samsara &mdash; the soul sent to one of the six worlds while the body remains on the field.</em></p><p>The target must attempt a Will save.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> It is stunned 1.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> Its soul is cast into one of the six realms for 1 minute: it is <strong>stunned</strong> for the duration, its body standing empty.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure but for 10 minutes, and on its return it is enfeebled 2 and stupefied 2 for an hour. No one comes back from the six worlds unchanged.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> At 20th level, you may target two creatures.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
